flowchart TD
    A[Initialize DataBus / fixed motor and base samples] --> B[DataBus.updateQ builds q and dq]
    B --> C[Pin_KinDyn: FK / Jacobians / dynamics]
    C --> D[JoyStickInterpreter: desired base command]
    D --> H[GaitScheduler: phase and contact state]
    H --> I[FootPlacement: swing foot target]
    I --> J[Main writes WBC inputs: Fr_ff / des_delta_q / des_dq / des_ddq]
    J --> K[WBC_priority.computeDdq: prioritized tasks]
    K --> L[WBC_priority.computeTau: qpOASES contact and torque QP]
    L --> M[PVT_Ctr: joint PVT torque output]
    M --> N[chrono duration]
    N --> E[DataLogger]
    N --> F[stdout timing / benchmark]
    E --> G[datalog.log]

    X[No MuJoCo viewer] -. boundary .-> A
    Y[No MuJoCo XML scene] -. boundary .-> A
    Z[Finite LoopNum = 10000] -. boundary .-> A
